Seeds the inaugural VIPI basket at base date 2026-05-18T16:00:00Z per
methodology §5 eligibility + §6 cap and equal-weighting.

Composition:
  vipi (headline)   20 constituents at weight 1/20 = 0.05
  vipi_open         20 constituents at weight 1/20 = 0.05
  vipi_closed        6 constituents at weight 1/6  = 0.166...

Total rows: 46. Primary key (effective_from, sub_index, vcmi) protects
against duplicate re-seed.

Eligibility evaluated via tools/queries/vipi_v0_1_3_eligibility_query.sql
against remote D1 on 2026-05-17 with reference_date='2026-04-30' and
continuity_start='2026-04-17'. Eligibility-query output captured to
~/Desktop/volt-session-logs/day77_eligibility_output_v2.json.

§5(4) Administrator-side curator override applied to
vcmi:claude-opus-4.7-undisclosed: Anthropic launched the model
2026-04-16; Volt price-aggregator Anthropic adapter was patched to
include claude-opus-4-7 on 2026-04-20 19:45 UTC. The 4 MOC closes on
2026-04-17, 2026-04-18, 2026-04-19, and 2026-04-20 are excluded from
both the numerator and denominator of the §5(4) continuity calculation
per the Administrator-side-infrastructure-outage carve-out. opus-4.7
continuity is recorded as 10/10 = 100% over the adjusted 10-day window.
Mandatory §5(4) disclosure pending population in
~/volthq/docs/vipi/VIPI_v0.1.3_reproducibility_appendix_TEMPLATE.md
on 2026-05-18 morning.

§6 cap applied independently per sub_index. vipi pre-cap pool: 32
ELIGIBLE → capped to 20 via tie-breaker cascade (mapping_count DESC,
high_conf_count DESC, alphabetical). vipi_open pre-cap pool: 26
ELIGIBLE → capped to 20 via same cascade. vipi_closed pre-cap pool: 6
ELIGIBLE → no cap application (under threshold).

Pre-reg 'Sub-index publication scope' subsection (commit 5141565)
ratifies six closed-license sole-issuer constituents (five Anthropic +
one OpenAI) — basket composition matches.

INSERT (not INSERT OR REPLACE) safeguards against re-application of
this migration to a non-empty basket for the same base date.
