+--   sub_index='vipi_open'    → 20 constituents (weight = 0.05 each, equal-weighted per §6)
+--   sub_index='vipi_closed'  → 6 constituents (weight = 1/6 ≈ 0.16666666666666666, equal-weighted per §6)
